wekws-tflite

This project contains code derived from WeKWS, licensed under the Apache
License 2.0. Original project: https://github.com/wenet-e2e/wekws

The bundled TensorFlow Lite Micro headers and static libraries are copied
unchanged from the original local WeKWS runtime dependency bundle. They are
derived from TensorFlow Lite for Microcontrollers and licensed under the
Apache License 2.0. Original project: https://github.com/tensorflow/tflite-micro

The optional live microphone demo bundles the unmodified build sources from
PortAudio v19.7.0, commit 147dd722548358763a8b649b3e4b41dfffbcfbb6.
Non-build documentation, examples, tests, Git metadata, and macOS AppleDouble
files were omitted. PortAudio is distributed under its own permissive license;
see third_party/portaudio/LICENSE.txt.

The bundled wake-word model and WAV samples are intended as technical
demonstrations. Users must review the rights of the training data, model
weights, and audio samples before commercial redistribution.
